00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,960
of honor and trust. The

416
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,960
problem with the system of honor and trust

417
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:17,960
is that human beings are involved.

418
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:19,960
So every

419
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,960
once in a while, you're going to have

420
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:23,960
a good fifth suspicion that something

421
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:25,960
has gone wrong If,

