00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:13,960
If there

476
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:15,960
are serious problems with the

477
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,960
advancement program in our troops,

478
00:23:17,960 --> 00:23:19,960
we start working towards

