00:32:21,960 --> 00:32:23,960
essential feature in which scout training

751
00:32:23,960 --> 00:32:25,960
differs from that of all other

752
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:27,960
organizations. where the system

753
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:29,960
is properly applied,

754
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:31,960
it is absolutely bound to bring success.

755
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:33,960
it can't help itself.

756
00:32:33,960 --> 00:32:35,960
the formation of boys into patrols

757
00:32:35,960 --> 00:32:37,960
of six to eight

758
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:39,960
and training them as separate units,

759
00:32:39,960 --> 00:32:41,960
each under their own responsible leader,

760
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,960
is the key to a good troop.

761
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:45,960
the patrol is the unit of scouting. always,

762
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:47,960
whether for work,

763
00:32:47,960 --> 00:32:49,960
for play, for discipline or duty,

764
00:32:49,960 --> 00:32:51,960
an invaluable step in character training

765
00:32:51,960 --> 00:32:53,960
is to put responsibility

766
00:32:53,960 --> 00:32:55,960
onto the individual.

767
00:32:55,960 --> 00:32:57,960
this is immediately gained

768
00:32:57,960 --> 00:32:59,960
when a patrol leader becomes responsible

769
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:01,960
